  },
  {
   "id": "2:126",
   "text": "First and foremost, I want you to set up your workspace with at least three monitors.",
   "key": "new:2:126",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 2,
   "span_start": 126
  },
  {
   "id": "2:212",
   "text": "It's crucial for efficient coding and easy reference.",
   "key": "new:2:212",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 2,
   "span_start": 212
  },
  {
   "id": "3:6",
   "text": "Now, regarding your coding style, I want you to develop a habit of always starting your variable names with 'y_'.",
   "key": "new:3:6",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 3,
   "span_start": 6
  },
  {
   "id": "3:120",
   "text": "This is a convention we follow in our team, and it's important for consistency and readability.",
   "key": "new:3:120",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 3,
   "span_start": 120
  },
  {
   "id": "5:6",
   "text": "We'll be covering more ground in the coming days, but for now, get settled and familiar with our practices.",
   "key": "new:5:6",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 5,
   "span_start": 6
  },
  {
   "id": "6:64",
   "text": "From now on, I'd like you to use two monitors when coding.",
   "key": "new:6:64",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 6,
   "span_start": 64
  },
  {
   "id": "6:123",
   "text": "It will increase your efficiency and make it easier to reference multiple sources simultaneously.",
   "key": "new:6:123",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 6,
   "span_start": 123
  },
  {
   "id": "7:57",
   "text": "That way, you can easily present your work to others without turning around.",
   "key": "new:7:57",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 7,
   "span_start": 57
  },
  {
   "id": "10:86",
   "text": "From now on, I need you to include try statements in your functions.",
   "key": "new:10:86",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 10,
   "span_start": 86
  },
  {
   "id": "10:155",
   "text": "It's crucial for robust code and preventing crashes.",
   "key": "new:10:155",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 10,
   "span_start": 155
  },
  {
   "id": "13:54",
   "text": "If you need to add comments for clarity, don't hesitate.",
   "key": "new:13:54",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 13,
   "span_start": 54
  },
  {
   "id": "13:111",
   "text": "It's better to over-communicate your thought process than leave your code cryptic.",
   "key": "new:13:111",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 13,
   "span_start": 111
  },
  {
   "id": "14:9",
   "text": "Effective commenting is an art, and it's always better to have too much information than not enough.",
   "key": "new:14:9",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 14,
   "span_start": 9
  },
  {
   "id": "15:84",
   "text": "We need to ensure it's rock-solid before integration.",
   "key": "new:15:84",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 15,
   "span_start": 84
  },
  {
   "id": "17:17",
   "text": "Collaboration is key in our line of work.",
   "key": "new:17:17",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
